    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d403-a3">

                <pb facs="0517" n="421" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg421"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Royal Prefecture of the Province of Palermo, Division</hi>
                                3,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Palermo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1897-07-13"><hi rendition="#italic">July 13,
                                1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>This commission of arbitration for emigration having rendered a decision in the
                    case of the subagents Giovanni Cundari and Antonino Costanzo, of Marineo, in
                    pursuance of a complaint made to the royal consulate-general under your charge
                    of the 26th day of July, 1895, by Andrea Guastella, Alfonso Valenti, Maria
                    Alderoni, and Giuseppe La Prata, emigrants, likewise of Marineo, I have the
                    honor to transmit to your excellency, through the proper channel, a copy of said
                    decision which has already been transmitted to the proper judicial authority in
                    order that it may be executed.</p>
                <p>For the prefect:</p>
                <closer>[Signature illegible.]</closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His excellency the consul-general of His Majesty the King of Italy at New
                        York.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
